  m_Name: QuestKS_B
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogData
  sentences:
  - "The forest is restless today\u2026 can you feel it?"
  - Strange creatures have begun to appear near this clearing.
  - Small, shapeless beings made of living slime.
  - They are weak alone, but they multiply quickly and spread through the forest.
  - If they are not stopped, they will consume everything in their path.
  - Show me your strength, little wanderer. Defeat 5 blue slimes and return to me.
